OL,3,GNEWSAPaused shopping centre homes plan
OL,4,Adivides locals
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth-east London residents are divided
OL,7,Fafter a billion-pound redevelopment of
OL,8,FLewisham Shopping Centre was paused by
OL,9,Fthe developer.
OL,11,FLast month, Landsec said it was
OL,12,F"deprioritising" the scheme, which
OL,13,Fincluded 1,744 homes, student
OL,14,Faccommodation and a new shopping
OL,15,Fcentre, due to "economic conditions"
OL,16,Fand the council's desire for more
OL,17,Faffordable homes.
OL,19,FWhile some residents agreed with Green
OL,20,FParty-run Lewisham Council, others
OL,21,Fmourned the loss of a "big opportunity"
OL,22,Ffor redevelopment.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
