OL,3,GNEWSAPaused shopping centre homes plan
OL,4,Adivides locals
OL,5,
OL,6,FSilvia Andreoletti, from the Adam Smith
OL,7,FInstitute think tank, said any
OL,8,Faffordable homes were better than none,
OL,9,Fas it meant an increased supply.
OL,10,FHomeless charity Shelter said there was
OL,11,Fan "urgent need" for more homes.
